0 Golden Puff - small yellow and black steam locomotive
0 Name: model.ldr
0 Author: Codex
0 !LDRAW_ORG Model
0 !KEYWORDS steam locomotive, yellow, black, six wheels
0 // All dimensions are LDU. Up is -Y; the locomotive faces -Z.
0 // Three complete catalogue wheelsets; the top studs engage the black chassis.
1 0 0 8 -80 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/2878c01.dat
1 0 0 8 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 parts/2878c01.dat
